7.  SUMMARY
====================================================================================================
  algebra          : g_N = u^2/(a0(1-u/a0)); nu = a0/u; inverse is a square root
  coefficient      : delta P_i = grad(delta Phi)/K * 1/(1+(k lambda_P)^2); (k lambda_P)^2 = 1.3e-12 at 0.1 h/Mpc
  linear order     : G_eff/G = 1+1/(k lambda_P)^2 = 7.6e11 -> k^-4 runaway. No linear eqn
  branch (a) cH    : sigma8 = 0.7619   [posit: no H anywhere in the action]
  branch (b) rms   : sigma8 = 2.267   [resummation; EXCLUDED, 243 sigma]
  inert / filtered : sigma8 = 0.7602   [G_eff = 1 on linear scales; -6.3% below Planck]
  delta_c(0.832)   : 0.677  (delta_collapse = 1.686)
  chi2(f sigma8)   : inert 7134.88/8 vs LCDM control 7.34/8

